Year 5000 candidate selection-ന്റെ നിർബന്ധിത seal 10 askBowl -> AnswerStream -> short rank bridge clean Stage 1 fixture. synthetic final bowls queried=0, successor=0, fixed bowl6=0; seal=10; candidate family size N=3. first=36491, direction number even ആയതിനാൽ step=-1, ആദ്യ answer acceptance region-ൽ തന്നെ; selected one-based candidate rank=2. expected outputs `36491,-1,2`.

